### ===========================================
### Notes
### ===========================================
# 
# The Inventory Service uses the Transactional Outbox pattern:
# - Events are stored in inventory_outbox table atomically with business data
# - A scheduled job (every 5 seconds) publishes unpublished events to Kafka
# - Old published events are cleaned up after 7 days
#
# Event Topics:
# - inventory.reserved - Ingredients successfully reserved
# - inventory.reservation.failed - Reservation failed (insufficient stock)
# - inventory.consumed - Ingredients consumed during preparation
# - inventory.released - Reservations released (order cancelled)
# - inventory.low-stock.alert - Stock below minimum threshold
#
# Stock Management:
# - Reservations temporarily hold stock (reserved_quantity)
# - available_quantity = current_quantity - reserved_quantity (computed column)
# - Consumption reduces both current_quantity and reserved_quantity
